| C4. | A single storey structure with an attic
above is only permissible if:
a) it is adjacent to a rear lane;
b) the height does not exceed 5.4m;
c) amenity to adjacent sites is
maintained;
d) No external balconies are proposed
for the attic room;
e) The attic room does not increase the
bulk of the building; |
